{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Family Reunion</i> blends the awkwardness of family dinners with the structure of idle and narrative games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a kid trapped at the table, surrounded by relatives, stories, and endless small talk \u2014 trying to make time pass as fast as possible.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/extras/041a8dab2dfa0c018628343ecd4d1e33.poster.avif?t=1761161221\" width=1170 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/extras/041a8dab2dfa0c018628343ecd4d1e33.webm?t=1761161221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/extras/041a8dab2dfa0c018628343ecd4d1e33.mp4?t=1761161221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between three archetypes \u2014 <strong>Introvert</strong>, <strong>Chatty</strong>, or <strong>Adventurer</strong> \u2014 each offering a different way to survive the dinner: through imagination, conversation, or exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/extras/1f86714832a80a0d9a1291b8750e7f2b.apng?t=1761161221\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/extras/1f86714832a80a0d9a1291b8750e7f2b.poster.avif?t=1761161221\" class=\"bb_img\" width=128 height=128 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/extras/4d5a575a0464790a58623a55de729ed9.gif?t=1761161221\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/extras/4d5a575a0464790a58623a55de729ed9.poster.avif?t=1761161221\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/extras/1d1ec2651900f0c596300a96bf166945.gif?t=1761161221\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/extras/1d1ec2651900f0c596300a96bf166945.poster.avif?t=1761161221\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you interact with the people and objects around you, new abilities and events unfold: spread gossip, sneak away to explore the house, or simply drift into daydreams. The faster you make time move, the closer you get to freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created using simple hand-coded web tools, <i>Family Reunion</i> embraces the DIY spirit of early internet games \u2014 personal, playful, and slightly uncomfortable.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4100460?t=1761161221","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4100460?t=1761161221","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/78ca534618a5254615498c1512d8478d79a09951/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761161221","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/78ca534618a5254615498c1512d8478d79a09951/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761161221","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Family Reunion</i> blends the awkwardness of family dinners with the structure of idle and narrative games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a kid trapped at the table, surrounded by relatives, stories, and endless small talk \u2014 trying to make time pass as fast as possible.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/extras/041a8dab2dfa0c018628343ecd4d1e33.poster.avif?t=1761161221\" width=1170 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/extras/041a8dab2dfa0c018628343ecd4d1e33.webm?t=1761161221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/extras/041a8dab2dfa0c018628343ecd4d1e33.mp4?t=1761161221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between three archetypes \u2014 <strong>Introvert</strong>, <strong>Chatty</strong>, or <strong>Adventurer</strong> \u2014 each offering a different way to survive the dinner: through imagination, conversation, or exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/extras/1f86714832a80a0d9a1291b8750e7f2b.apng?t=1761161221\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/extras/1f86714832a80a0d9a1291b8750e7f2b.poster.avif?t=1761161221\" class=\"bb_img\" width=128 height=128 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/extras/4d5a575a0464790a58623a55de729ed9.gif?t=1761161221\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/extras/4d5a575a0464790a58623a55de729ed9.poster.avif?t=1761161221\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/extras/1d1ec2651900f0c596300a96bf166945.gif?t=1761161221\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/extras/1d1ec2651900f0c596300a96bf166945.poster.avif?t=1761161221\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you interact with the people and objects around you, new abilities and events unfold: spread gossip, sneak away to explore the house, or simply drift into daydreams. The faster you make time move, the closer you get to freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created using simple hand-coded web tools, <i>Family Reunion</i> embraces the DIY spirit of early internet games \u2014 personal, playful, and slightly uncomfortable.</p>","developers":["Waibinin - Leandro Waibe"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/d32fae327943a3b6326734c3a6d9e785bc3766d3/header.jpg?t=1761161221","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 LTS or equivalent (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated GPU with OpenGL 3.0+ support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires libnss3, libatk1.0, libx11, libxcomposite, libxdamage, libxrandr, and libgtk-3-0.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04 LTS or Fedora 38+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15 (Catalina) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory